<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
  <title>중1 수학 : 부채꼴의 중심각, 호, 넓이의 정비례 탐험실</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jua&family=Pretendard:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');
    body {
      font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif;
      touch-action: manipulation;
      user-select: none;
      -webkit-user-select: none;
    }
    .font-kids {
      font-family: 'Jua', cursive, sans-serif;
    }
    .math-arc {
      position: relative;
      display: inline-block;
      padding-top: 0.32em;
      margin: 0 0.12em;
      line-height: 1;
      vertical-align: -0.05em;
    }
    .math-arc::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0.02em;
      left: 1px;
      right: 1px;
      height: 0.34em;
      border-top: 2.2px solid currentColor;
      border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0 / 100% 100% 0 0;
    }
    .pie-piece {
      transition: all 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .pie-piece:hover {
      filter: brightness(1.08) drop-shadow(0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.15));
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 min-h-screen flex flex-col">

  <!-- Header -->
  <header class="bg-indigo-600 text-white shadow-md sticky top-0 z-30">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-3 flex items-center justify-between">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-xl shadow-inner">
          <span>🍕</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-200">교과서 194~195쪽 연계</span>
          <h1 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-kids tracking-wide">부채꼴의 중심각과 호, 넓이의 정비례</h1>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Tab Navigation -->
    <nav class="bg-indigo-700 px-4">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto flex gap-2 overflow-x-auto py-1 scrollbar-none">
        <button onclick="switchTab('rotate')" id="tab-rotate" class="tab-btn active px-4 py-2 rounded-t-lg font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-slate-50 text-indigo-700 shadow-sm transition">
          <span>🔄</span> 1. 회전하여 포개기
        </button>
        <button onclick="switchTab('fold')" id="tab-fold" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-t-lg font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5 text-indigo-100 hover:bg-indigo-600/50 transition">
          <span>📑</span> 2. 종이접기 & 정비례
        </button>
        <button onclick="switchTab('problem')" id="tab-problem" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-t-lg font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5 text-indigo-100 hover:bg-indigo-600/50 transition">
          <span>✏️</span> 3. 교과서 문제 3 풀이실
        </button>
        <button onclick="switchTab('equalchord')" id="tab-equalchord" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-t-lg font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5 text-indigo-100 hover:bg-indigo-600/50 transition">
          <span>📐</span> 4. 중심각과 현의 관계
        </button>
        <button onclick="switchTab('chord')" id="tab-chord" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-t-lg font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5 text-indigo-100 hover:bg-indigo-600/50 transition">
          <span>⚠️</span> 5. 생각 넓히기 (현)
        </button>
        <button onclick="switchTab('quiz')" id="tab-quiz" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-t-lg font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5 text-indigo-100 hover:bg-indigo-600/50 transition">
          <span>⭐</span> 6. 스피드 퀴즈
        </button>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Content Layout -->
  <main class="max-w-5xl w-full mx-auto p-4 flex-1 flex flex-col gap-4">

    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <!-- TAB 1: 회전하여 포개기 (교과서 194쪽 상단 생각 2) -->
    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <section id="section-rotate" class="tab-section flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-4 flex-1">
      <!-- Left: Interactive Rotate & Overlay SVG Canvas -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5 flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-between relative min-h-[420px]">
        <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">
            <span class="bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold mr-1.5">교과서 194p 생각 2</span>
            중심각의 크기가 같은 두 부채꼴 회전시키기
          </div>
          <button onclick="resetRotate()" class="text-xs text-indigo-600 hover:underline font-semibold flex items-center gap-1">
            <span>↺</span> 처음 위치로
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Interactive Rotation Canvas -->
        <div class="w-full max-w-[340px] aspect-square relative my-auto select-none">
          <svg id="rotateSvg" viewBox="0 0 400 400" class="w-full h-full drop-shadow-sm overflow-visible">
            <!-- Circumference Base -->
            <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="160" fill="#f8fafc" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2.5" />
            <!-- Fixed Reference Sector 1 (기준 부채꼴) -->
            <g id="fixedSectorLayer"></g>
            <!-- Rotating Sector 2 (회전 부채꼴) -->
            <g id="rotatingSectorLayer"></g>
            <!-- Center O -->
            <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="6" fill="#1e293b" />
            <text x="200" y="225" font-size="16" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b" text-anchor="middle">O</text>
            <!-- Overlap Match Badge -->
            <g id="overlapBadgeLayer"></g>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <!-- Controls: Rotate Slider & Auto-Animate Button -->
        <div class="w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3.5 flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">부채꼴 회전 각도: <span id="rotateDegText" class="text-indigo-600 font-extrabold text-sm">0°</span></span>
            <button onclick="autoRotateOverlay()" id="btnAutoRotate" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white rounded-lg text-xs font-bold shadow-sm transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span id="autoRotateIcon">▶</span>
              <span id="autoRotateBtnText">빙글 회전하여 포개기</span>
            </button>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <input type="range" id="rotateSlider" min="0" max="115" value="0" step="1" oninput="setSectorRotation(this.value)" class="w-full h-2 bg-slate-200 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-indigo-600">
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-semibold px-1">
            <span>떨어져 있는 상태 (0°)</span>
            <span class="text-indigo-600 font-bold">완전히 포개어지는 지점 (115°) &rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Overlap Verification & Explanation -->
      <div class="w-full lg:w-96 flex flex-col gap-3">
        <!-- Live Status Card -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-50 to-indigo-50 border border-rose-100 rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-sm">
          <div class="text-xs font-extrabold text-rose-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span>📑</span> 포개어짐 상태 확인
          </div>
          <h2 id="overlapStatusTitle" class="text-lg font-kids text-slate-900 mb-2">
            두 부채꼴이 떨어져 있어요!
          </h2>

          <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
            <div class="bg-white p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between shadow-xs">
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-700 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="text-rose-500">📐</span> 중심각의 크기
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs font-extrabold text-rose-600 bg-rose-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">
                둘 다 45°로 동일
              </span>
            </div>

            <div id="checkArcCard" class="bg-white p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between shadow-xs transition">
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-700 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="text-amber-500">🌈</span> 호의 길이 포갬
              </span>
              <span id="checkArcBadge" class="text-xs font-extrabold text-slate-400">
                회전 대기 중...
              </span>
            </div>

            <div id="checkAreaCard" class="bg-white p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between shadow-xs transition">
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-700 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="text-emerald-500">🍕</span> 부채꼴 넓이 포갬
              </span>
              <span id="checkAreaBadge" class="text-xs font-extrabold text-slate-400">
                회전 대기 중...
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Textbook Key Rule Box (포갠 후에만 확인 가능하도록 잠금 시스템 적용) -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-sm mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span>📖</span> 교과서 194쪽 핵심 탐구 원리</span>
              <span id="rotateLockBadge" class="text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-700 bg-amber-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">포개기 대기 중 🔒</span>
            </h3>

            <!-- Locked State Card (포개기 전) -->
            <div id="rotateLockedBox" class="p-4 bg-slate-50 border border-dashed border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-center flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center text-lg shadow-xs">
                <span>🔒</span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800" id="rotateLockTitle">핵심 원리가 잠겨있어요! 🔒</div>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 leading-relaxed" id="rotateLockDesc">
                왼쪽 슬라이더나 <strong>[빙글 회전하여 포개기]</strong> 버튼으로<br>
                중심각이 같은 두 부채꼴을 먼저 <strong>100% 포개어 보세요!</strong>
              </p>
              <button id="btnUnlockRotate" onclick="unlockRotateConclusion()" disabled class="mt-1 px-4 py-2 bg-slate-200 text-slate-400 text-xs font-bold rounded-xl cursor-not-allowed transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span>🔑</span>
                <span id="btnUnlockRotateText">완전히 포갠 후 확인 가능</span>
              </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Unlocked State Card (100% 포갠 후 확인 클릭 시 공개) -->
            <div id="rotateUnlockedBox" class="hidden text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-2.5 leading-relaxed animate-fadeIn">
              <p class="p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl">
                한 원에서 <strong>중심각의 크기가 같은 두 부채꼴</strong>은 원의 중심 O를 축으로 회전시키면 <strong>서로 완전히 포갤 수 있습니다(합동).</strong>
              </p>
              <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-slate-700">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-1.5">
                  <span class="text-indigo-600 font-bold">&check;</span>
                  <span>따라서 두 부채꼴의 <strong>호의 길이는 서로 같다!</strong></span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-1.5">
                  <span class="text-indigo-600 font-bold">&check;</span>
                  <span>따라서 두 부채꼴의 <strong>넓이도 서로 완전히 같다!</strong></span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-1.5">
                  <span class="text-slate-500 font-bold">&bull;</span>
                  <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">역으로 호의 길이나 넓이가 같으면 중심각의 크기도 서로 같습니다.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
              <div class="p-2.5 bg-emerald-50 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 text-[11px] text-emerald-900 font-bold text-center">
                ✨ 직접 포개어 봄으로써 두 부채꼴의 호의 길이와 넓이가 같음을 직접 확인했습니다!
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-3 pt-2.5 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400">
            <span id="rotateFooterHint">회전 슬라이더를 115°까지 끝까지 밀어보세요!</span>
            <button onclick="autoRotateOverlay()" id="quickOverlayBtn" class="text-indigo-600 font-bold hover:underline">
              원클릭 포개기 &rarr;
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <!-- TAB 2: 종이접기 & 정비례 탐구 (교과서 194쪽 함께해요) -->
    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <section id="section-fold" class="tab-section hidden flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-4 flex-1">
      <!-- Left: Interactive Folded Circle SVG Canvas -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5 flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-between relative min-h-[420px]">
        <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">교과서 194p 함께해요</span>
            <span>원 모양 종이를 3번 접어 나눈 8개 부채꼴</span>
          </div>
          <button onclick="resetSlices()" class="text-xs text-indigo-600 hover:underline font-semibold flex items-center gap-1">
            <span>↺</span> 1조각으로 초기화
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- 360° ÷ 8 = 45° 수학적 원리 배너 추가 -->
        <div class="w-full bg-indigo-50/80 border border-indigo-200/70 rounded-xl px-3 py-1.5 mb-2 text-xs flex items-center justify-between text-indigo-900">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold">
            <span class="text-indigo-600 text-sm">💡</span>
            <span>원 전체(<strong class="text-indigo-700">360°</strong>)를 똑같이 8개로 나누었으므로:</span>
          </span>
          <span class="bg-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 font-extrabold text-rose-600 shadow-xs">
            1조각 중심각 = 360° &divide; 8 = 45°
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Interactive 8 Slices SVG Canvas -->
        <div class="w-full max-w-[340px] aspect-square relative my-auto select-none">
          <svg id="slicesSvg" viewBox="0 0 400 400" class="w-full h-full drop-shadow-sm overflow-visible">
            <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="160" fill="#f8fafc" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2.5" />
            <g id="slicesContainer"></g>
            <g id="sliceLabelsContainer"></g>
            <g id="circleLetters"></g>
            <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="5" fill="#1e293b" />
            <text x="200" y="222" font-size="16" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b" text-anchor="middle">O</text>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <!-- Controls: Slices Slider -->
        <div class="w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3 flex flex-col gap-2">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">
            <span>부채꼴 조각 수: <span id="sliceCountBadge" class="text-indigo-600 font-extrabold text-sm">1조각 (45°)</span></span>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
              <button onclick="changeSlice(-1)" class="w-6 h-6 rounded bg-white border border-slate-300 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-slate-100">-</button>
              <button onclick="changeSlice(1)" class="w-6 h-6 rounded bg-white border border-slate-300 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-slate-100">+</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <input type="range" id="sliceSlider" min="1" max="8" value="1" step="1" oninput="setSliceCount(this.value)" class="w-full h-2 bg-slate-200 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-indigo-600">
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold px-1">
            <span>1조각(45°)</span>
            <span>2조각(90°)</span>
            <span>3조각(135°)</span>
            <span>4조각(180°)</span>
            <span>...</span>
            <span>8조각(360°)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Real-time Multiplier Table & Concept -->
      <div class="w-full lg:w-96 flex flex-col gap-3">
        <!-- Live Multiplier Card -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 to-blue-50 border border-indigo-100 rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
            <span class="text-xs font-extrabold text-indigo-600 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>📊</span> 배수 실시간 관찰
            </span>
            <span class="text-[11px] bg-white/80 border border-indigo-200 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold">
              예시: 1조각 = 호 3cm, 넓이 6cm²
            </span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-kids text-slate-900 mb-3">
            기본 부채꼴의 <span id="kMultiplier" class="text-indigo-600 underline font-black">1배</span>
          </h2>

          <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
            <!-- 1. Central Angle -->
            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-between shadow-xs">
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-700 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-rose-500">📐</span> 중심각의 크기
              </span>
              <div class="text-right">
                <span id="metricAngle" class="text-base font-extrabold text-rose-600">45°</span>
                <span id="metricAngleRatio" class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 block">(360° &divide; 8 = 45° &times; 1)</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 2. Arc Length -->
            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-between shadow-xs">
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-700 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-500">🌈</span> 호의 길이 (예시)
              </span>
              <div class="text-right">
                <span id="metricArc" class="text-base font-extrabold text-amber-600">3 cm</span>
                <span id="metricArcRatio" class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 block">(3 cm &times; 1배)</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3. Sector Area -->
            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-between shadow-xs">
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-700 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-emerald-500">🍕</span> 부채꼴 넓이 (예시)
              </span>
              <div class="text-right">
                <span id="metricArea" class="text-base font-extrabold text-emerald-600">6 cm²</span>
                <span id="metricAreaRatio" class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 block">(6 cm² &times; 1배)</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Mathematical Conclusion Box -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-sm mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span>🎓</span> 교과서 194쪽 공식 정리</span>
              <span id="foldProgressBadge" class="text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-700 bg-amber-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">탐구 진행: 1 / 8</span>
            </h3>

            <!-- Locked State Card (Before exploring all 8 slices) -->
            <div id="foldLockedBox" class="p-4 bg-slate-50 border border-dashed border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-center flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center text-lg shadow-xs">
                <span>🔒</span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800" id="foldLockTitle">공식 결론이 잠겨있어요! 🔒</div>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 leading-relaxed" id="foldLockDesc">
                왼쪽 원에서 <strong>8개의 부채꼴 조각</strong>을 직접 클릭하며<br>
                조각 수에 따라 중심각과 호, 넓이가 어떻게 변하는지 확인해 보세요.
              </p>
              <!-- Progress bar -->
              <div class="w-full bg-slate-200 rounded-full h-2 mt-1 overflow-hidden">
